msgid "#### Installation"
msgstr "#### 安装"

msgid "#### Model Quantization"
msgstr "#### 模型量化"

msgid ""
"Once you have a quantized model which is generated by **ModelSlim**, you can"
" use vLLM Ascend for inference by specifying the `--quantization ascend` "
"parameter to enable quantization features, while for models quantized by "
"**LLM-Compressor**, it is not necessary to add this parameter."
msgstr ""
"一旦您拥有了由 **ModelSlim** 生成的量化模型，您可以通过指定 `--quantization ascend` 参数来使用 vLLM "
"Ascend 进行推理，以启用量化功能；而对于由 **LLM-Compressor** 量化的模型，则无需添加此参数。"

msgid "### 3. Native FP8 checkpoints (no quantization step needed)"
msgstr "### 3. 原生 FP8 检查点（无需量化步骤）"

msgid "How the weights are executed depends on the hardware:"
msgstr "权重的执行方式取决于硬件："

msgid ""
"Layers the checkpoint left unquantized, such as `visual.merger.*` on "
"multimodal models, are listed in `ignored_layers` or "
"`modules_to_not_convert` and are served unquantized."
msgstr ""
"检查点中未量化的层（例如多模态模型上的 `visual.merger.*`）会列在 `ignored_layers` 或 "
"`modules_to_not_convert` 中，并以未量化方式提供。"

msgid ""
"Only the block-wise flavour is supported. A native FP8 checkpoint without "
"`weight_block_size` (per-tensor or per-channel scales) has no Ascend "
"execution path yet; re-quantize it with ModelSlim or LLM-Compressor instead."
msgstr ""
"仅支持块级（block-wise）形式。没有 `weight_block_size`（逐张量或逐通道缩放因子）的原生 FP8 检查点目前没有 "
"Ascend 执行路径；请改用 ModelSlim 或 LLM-Compressor 对其进行重新量化。"

msgid ""
"Many models are now published directly in FP8, for example "
"[Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8](https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8) "
"and [zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash](https://huggingface.co/zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash). "
"Their `config.json` carries `\"quant_method\": \"fp8\"` together with a "
"`weight_block_size`, meaning every quantized weight is stored as "
"`float8_e4m3fn` plus one `float32` scale per weight block. vLLM Ascend "
"detects and serves these checkpoints as published, so no offline re-"
"quantization is required:"
msgstr ""
"许多模型现在直接以FP8格式发布，例如[Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8](https://modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8)和[zai-"
"org/GLM-5.3-Flash](https://huggingface.co/zai-"
"org/GLM-5.3-Flash)。它们的`config.json`中包含`\"quant_method\": "
"\"fp8\"`以及`weight_block_size`，这意味着每个量化权重都以`float8_e4m3fn`格式存储，并为每个权重块附带一个`float32`缩放因子。vLLM"
" Ascend能够检测并按原样提供这些检查点，因此无需进行离线重新量化："

msgid ""
"- **950PR&950DT Products**: the block scales are re-grouped into MXFP8 at load time, so weights stay at one byte per element and the native FP8 matmul is used.\n"
"- **Other Ascend generations**: the block scales are resolved into the model dtype at load time and served by the BF16 matmul. Numerically equivalent to the checkpoint, but plan for roughly twice the weight memory."
msgstr ""
"- **Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品**：加载时块缩放会被重新分组为 MXFP8，因此权重保持每个元素一个字节，并使用原生 FP8 矩阵乘法。\n"
"- **其他昇腾代际**：加载时块缩放会被解析为模型 dtype，并由 BF16 矩阵乘法执行。数值上与检查点等价，但请按大约两倍的权重内存进行规划。"

msgid "#### Qwen3.8 Flash Next PLE n-gram table INT8"
msgstr "#### Qwen3.8 Flash Next PLE n-gram 表 INT8"

msgid ""
"Qwen3.8 Flash Next stores its large PLE n-gram embedding as checkpoint row shards named\n"
"`...ple.ple_embedding.ngram_embedding.shard_N.weight`. These are hashed n-gram vector rows,\n"
"not readable tokenizer vocabulary entries. The PLE table format is independent of the\n"
"W8A8 or MXFP8 recipe used for linear layers and MTP."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8 Flash Next 将其大型 PLE n-gram 嵌入以检查点行分片的形式存储，分片命名为\n"
"`...ple.ple_embedding.ngram_embedding.shard_N.weight`。这些是经过哈希的 n-gram 向量行，\n"
"并非可读的分词器词表条目。PLE 表格式与线性层和 MTP 所使用的\n"
"W8A8 或 MXFP8 量化方案无关。"

msgid ""
"The [Qwen4Exp ModelSlim adapter](https://gitcode.com/code_mingming/msmodelslim/tree/master-qwen38-1022)\n"
"supports symmetric INT8 PLE tables. Add the following to the model recipe's `spec` section;\n"
"for MTP linear-layer selection, start from the\n"
"[MTP recipe](https://gitcode.com/code_mingming/msmodelslim/blob/master-qwen38-1022/lab_practice/qwen4_exp_flash_next/qwen4_w8a8_mtp.yaml)\n"
"and change its PLE setting from `bf16`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The linked MTP recipe is a configuration reference; it does not establish that MTP\n"
"weights in an existing export were quantized. Check `quant_model_description.json`\n"
"in the exported model. If all `mtp.*` entries are marked `FLOAT`, its MTP weights\n"
"remain unquantized."
msgstr ""
"链接的 MTP recipe 仅作为配置参考；它并不能证明现有导出模型中的 MTP\n"
"权重已被量化。请检查导出模型中的 `quant_model_description.json`。\n"
"如果所有 `mtp.*` 条目都标记为 `FLOAT`，则其 MTP 权重\n"
"仍未被量化。"

msgid ""
"Run ModelSlim against the original BF16 checkpoint with the completed "
"recipe:"
msgstr "使用已完成的 recipe 对原始 BF16 检查点运行 ModelSlim："

msgid ""
"For each table row, ModelSlim groups 32 adjacent columns. For a group `x`, it computes\n"
"`scale = max(max(abs(x)) / 127, 1e-12)` and\n"
"`q = clamp(round(x / scale), -127, 127)`. The output holds `shard_N.weight` as signed\n"
"INT8 with the original `[rows, width]` shape, and `shard_N.scale` as FP32 with shape\n"
"`[rows, width / 32]`. Its `quant_model_description.json` records\n"
"`shard_N.quant_type: INT8_SYM`; `quant_model_weights.safetensors.index.json` maps both\n"
"tensors to their shard files. The smaller PLE projections, norms, convolution weights,\n"
"and integer hash-layout buffers retain their source dtypes."
msgstr ""
"对于表的每一行，ModelSlim 将相邻的 32 列分为一组。对于组 `x`，它计算\n"
"`scale = max(max(abs(x)) / 127, 1e-12)` 和\n"
"`q = clamp(round(x / scale), -127, 127)`。输出中 `shard_N.weight` 为有符号\n"
"INT8，保持原始 `[rows, width]` 形状；`shard_N.scale` 为 FP32，形状为\n"
"`[rows, width / 32]`。其 `quant_model_description.json` 记录\n"
"`shard_N.quant_type: INT8_SYM`；`quant_model_weights.safetensors.index.json` 将两个\n"
"张量映射到各自的分片文件。较小的 PLE 投影、归一化、卷积权重\n"
"以及整数哈希布局缓冲区保留其源数据类型。"

msgid ""
"At inference time, a selected row is reconstructed as\n"
"`weight[row, column].float() * scale[row, column // 32]` before the PLE projections.\n"
"This is lossy: use the original BF16 checkpoint when exact source values are needed.\n"
"Check every table has a matching scale with the expected shape, then compare sampled\n"
"reconstructed rows and model outputs against the BF16 PLE baseline. A small table\n"
"reconstruction error alone does not establish generation accuracy."
msgstr ""
"在推理时，选中的行会在 PLE 投影之前按\n"
"`weight[row, column].float() * scale[row, column // 32]` 重建。\n"
"这是有损的：当需要精确的源数值时，请使用原始 BF16 检查点。\n"
"检查每个表都有形状符合预期的匹配 scale，然后将采样的重建行和模型输出\n"
"与 BF16 PLE 基线进行对比。仅凭较小的表重建误差\n"
"并不能证明生成精度。"

msgid ""
"If the starting point is an existing ModelSlim W8A8/MXFP8 export whose PLE tables are\n"
"still BF16, convert only its PLE table shards into a **new** model directory. Preserve\n"
"other weight shards, add the scale keys to the index, set the `INT8_SYM` description\n"
"markers, and recompute the index's `metadata.total_size` from the actual tensor\n"
"payloads. Do not run the full-model quantizer on an already quantized checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"如果起点是现有的 ModelSlim W8A8/MXFP8 导出模型，且其 PLE 表\n"
"仍为 BF16，则仅将其 PLE 表分片转换到一个**新的**模型目录中。保留\n"
"其他权重分片，将 scale 键添加到索引中，设置 `INT8_SYM` 描述\n"
"标记，并根据实际张量负载重新计算索引的 `metadata.total_size`。\n"
"不要对已量化的检查点运行全模型量化器。"

msgid ""
"The current Ascend PLE INT8 runtime path keeps the table on device and dequantizes\n"
"only looked-up rows. Pinned-host PLE offload is not supported for this format and\n"
"fails explicitly during model initialization."
msgstr ""
"当前昇腾 PLE INT8 运行时路径将表保留在设备上，并且仅对\n"
"被查找的行进行反量化。此格式不支持固定主机内存的 PLE 卸载，\n"
"并会在模型初始化期间显式报错。"
